      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex (GPT-6 Astra), reconciled from separately frozen Tibetan-first and English-first originals. GMR English and source Wylie remain verbatim; no hgm_gloss promotion. de ltar is a complete manner phrase, this were how, at d3; na supplies If. The first explicit dngos po gsum is fronted as the opening three objects and resumed by they; the earlier Tibetan gsum qualifies the beings. la brten nas owns through as the dependency relation of the ripening process. gsum ga is the collective compound all three, with narrower gsum/three and ga/all members. ma rtogs owns the anaphoric predicate do not at d3: do resumes perceiving and is not a lexical definition of rtogs. kyis has no separate English case word because its causal agent is the subject karma in the active planted construction. The final description of those who refuse to accept the denial of outer objects elaborates the previous argument; only bkag/refute is aligned there."
